A '''Super Scorcher''' is an {{Epic}} item that removes [[Pet Items]] in the [[Rift Dimension]].

== Obtaining ==
A '''Super Scorcher''' can be purchased from {{NPCSprite|Plumber Joe (Rift);Plumber Joe}} for {{Motes|5k}}.

== Usage ==
Right-clicking a [[Pet]] whilst holding a '''Super Scorcher''' will open a menu to confirm removing the pet item. Removing a [[Pet Item]] costs {{Motes}} depending on rarity; retrieving the [[Pet Item]] consumes the '''Super Scorcher'''.

